Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.78,0:00:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's grey for 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,society,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.18,0:01:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die tomorrow,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die tomorrow,\NI'm going to die tomorrow!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.56,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.94,0:01:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisuke and his friends were on a\Nchase to save Ken from their enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had to stop and\Nfight the evil Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who were running amok throughout the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.62,0:01:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving the others behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.26,0:01:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisuke continued the chase until he\Ncaught up with Archnemon and her group,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:01:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only to be stopped by\Nanother evil villain.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(270,0)\fscx120\fscy120\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(316,328)}The Dark Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.12,0:02:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gateway to the world of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have come to collect\Nthe seeds of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon, a Mega Digimon known to be the\Nleader of the four notorious evil Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His weapon, the deadly and\Npowerful Flame Inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did Demon get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It surprises me how you've bothered to\Ncome all the way here to make trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the rest of the gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me the Chosen One's got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choose your words carefully\Nif you don't want to anger me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Daisuke, what's\Nthat guy talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:03:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I'm planning to stick\Naround to find out what's really going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Daisuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon is in Hikarigaoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get to Hikarigaoka! Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going as fast as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them to hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we're gonna fight again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still up to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a choice, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you feel like you can't\Ndo it, don't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember that nobody is forcing\Nyou to do anything you don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't want to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have stayed at home and\Nlet you guys handle those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all behind you, so be brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikarigaoka,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's where Phantomon opened the gate\Nto invade the world and make it his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and it's where I saw\Nyour DJ when I was small.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so special about that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if the Digimon world is\Nsomehow connected to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you doing, Aquilamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, but I'm worried\Nabout you, Keo. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can still do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.86,0:04:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surrender the seeds to me at once, or else\NI will have to take it from you by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Temper, temper, demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really want it\Nthat bad, then take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.03,0:04:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that the seeds are\Ntransplanted in the children,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.16,0:04:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no more use for the boy genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can do whatever he wants\Nwith him for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-mon, head for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biggie, nap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Cam, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-mon changes to X-V-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon changes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the seeds of darkness now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, you better get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those kids are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.66,0:05:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I think I'll take the children too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, they're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sin. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,XV-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.64,0:05:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V .A. Engagymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ben-Gonamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:05:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give him a chance to fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy him now! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Shakkoumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dual Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Silphymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your best, Silphymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall have to teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.60,0:07:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flame Inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Imperialdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,— — — — — Then, 2-step fire
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring the time to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you? Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.03,0:07:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I need to be ready, Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Charge Razor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to be ready, Chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.82,0:08:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can beat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your efforts will\Nonly prove futile. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if nothing happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Early today,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monsters were again seen running\Namok in the cities of Ginza,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takeshiba, Ikebukoru, and Nerima.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The busy streets were filled with people\Nrunning for cover as the monsters...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken isn't home yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Ken is nowhere near Hikari Gaoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't think of going there alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's been gone for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if he's been kidnapped too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if the monster\Nattacks the kidnappers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he must be at a friend's house\Nworking on a school project or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he chose to stay there\Nuntil it's safe to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I told him to call\Nif something bad happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, where are you and what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've seen how powerful I am,\Nwill you come and join me, Ken Ichijoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need more persuading, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mode Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighter form!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That light!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same one that protected us and\Nshielded us when we flew around the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shall stop this at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are brave as you are foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't hold him long!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now, Daisuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody think of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will soon become weak and I shall win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:10:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.16,0:11:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you stay in the world of\Nevil and darkness where you belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you leave us alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's a Digimon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why can't we drive\Nhim back to his own
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world like what we did\Nbefore with the other ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody go back to the car and\Nask Shu if he brought his laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can use that to open the gate and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what your children had in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you have the\Npower to open a digit gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you think we were\Nable to travel And spread
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evil from one dimension to\Nanother. It's no use driving
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me back To the Digimon\Nworld For I can easily come
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back Whenever and wherever\NI like And take revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use. There's no way\Nwe can beat this one. Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you give up so soon We can\Nget through this We've been in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tighter situations before And we\Nnever lost But this is different,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisuke Don't tell me\Nyou're giving up too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But can't you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the combined powers\Nof Imperialdramon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silphymon and Shakkoumon\Nweren't enough to beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we drive back to the Digimon\Nworld, he'll only come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, what else can we possibly\Ndo to get rid of that monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no hope left for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be another way to defeat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only there was a way to trap him\Nsomewhere A place between the Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world and ours that he can never ever\Nget out of No matter what he does
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sea of Darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, if I remember it right, it's a\Ndimension totally different from theirs
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can seal him up in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he won't be able to come back\Nand bother us again Even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can any of us open a gate that\Nwould bring Demon to that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anyone know how we\Ncan possibly do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know how he got to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just happened all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just disappeared into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it. It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just surrender and\Ngive me the seeds of darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give you my word that I shall return\Nto the Digimon world once I have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them and you will never see me in\Nthis pathetic world of yours again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.06,0:13:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why don't you just shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been using my\Ndigivice to open a gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That took me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukio said something about\NHikarigaoka having a secret gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.36,0:13:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can try to open that\Ngate with my D3 and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,send that monster to the\Ndarkness where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to control it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's working. I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let it carry you away, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken's in pain, but he's trying to hold\Non and not give in to the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's facing his fear\Nand sacrificing himself
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just to save everyone\Nfrom that awful monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a coward I've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mustn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know you're very scared,\Nbut we're all behind you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.68,0:15:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope,\NKen, so don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find the darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a different person now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.34,0:15:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.28,0:15:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the Digimon Kaiser anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that you overcome the power of\Ndarkness and all the evil that it brings!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's more, you've already paid\Nfor all the bad things you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you have nothing to be afraid of now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can fight the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel the warmth of Daisuke's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel Ken's fear going away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in yourself, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness take you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight it with all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send Daemon back to the\Ndarkness where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragoman's Ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now! Positron Laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.56,0:16:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ghost guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.34,0:16:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of V-Golf!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foolish humans, I shall come back\Nand take revenge, I swear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made a mistake of opening\Nthe gate too soon, demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful way to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Hikarigaoka, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you all to remember this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.66,0:17:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukio, stop! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can all go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.08,0:17:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The police will take care of them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to worry about, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we have a problem, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's room for only one\Nmore one of you has to take
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bus I live in a different
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,area so go on Ken get in I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't take the bus but it's\Nalready pretty late my mom
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knows about this so she doesn't\Nmind me coming home late
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't worry I'll be\Nfine you're comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks. So that's\Nwhy they kidnapped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But tell us, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will happen to the\Nchildren now that they also have
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Seeds of Darkness inside them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukiya said that they'll become\Nsmarter and stronger like an
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,athlete with a brain of a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And worse, they did it because\Nthey wanted to be just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.18,0:18:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean there's a possibility they\Nmight become like the Digimon Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.98,0:18:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope not. I repeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of the missing children have already
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been found and are now\Nunder police custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the kidnappers\Nhave yet to be arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken isn't with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I think we better call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ken, thank heavens\Nyou're safe. Yes, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.64,0:18:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, why do you always have to\Nmake your mother worry like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, I want to know\Nwhat you've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my fault, ma 'am I\Ndidn't notice how late it was
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't make\NDaisuke pay for my mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all right, young man
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's important is that his home's safe\Nand sound Thanks for understanding, Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Motomiya Yes, good night\NThanks for the ride, Shu
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisuke, who is that guy? Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.06,0:19:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Joe Kiddo's big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he in college or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you like the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought Yamato was the only guy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the concert, I saw the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm through with boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I need is a mature young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a college student will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.42,0:20:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she was adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That same night, Ken finally decided\Nto tell his parents about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About the Digimon world, about the\NDigimon Emperor, and about Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Wormmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, the missing children were\Nbrought safely back to their families.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of them looked or acted differently\Nfrom the way they did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the seeds of darkness were\Nstarting to work inside their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.05,0:20:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is going smoothly as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we need to do now is\Nsit back, relax, and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:20:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those seeds will grow and take\Nover their minds and hearts Until
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the flower of darkness blooms\Nin all its evil splendor Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.09,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.60,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.08,0:21:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you connect\Ntogether with your hand?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.02,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.10,0:21:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you connect with your strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you connect with your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:22:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always, I always, I connect to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.20,0:22:03.21,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.21,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.22,0:22:17.14,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.14,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Adventure 02!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.01,0:22:58.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\fscx110\fscy110\pos(218,149)}BlackWarGreymon
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.01,0:22:58.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\fscx115\fscy115\pos(390,368)}WarGreymon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.80,0:23:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.

